(6419449, 952080, 132694, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The photograph has a great dynamic range.  The lines are crisp and details are sufficient.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The photograph has a great dynamic range.  The lines are crisp and details are sufficient.', '2011-05-20 11:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419453, 952422, 132694, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty picture with some color in eyes, ears and nose.  Two things could improve this shot  1. you are still way below blowing out the highlights, so you could use that ceiling.  2.  The picture has a soft subject, but a little sharpening would improve it.  If you increased the contrast a little, probably you could go without extra sharpening.</td>', 'This is a pretty picture with some color in eyes, ears and nose.  Two things could improve this shot  1. you are still way below blowing out the highlights, so you could use that ceiling.  2.  The picture has a soft subject, but a little sharpening would improve it.  If you increased the contrast a little, probably you could go without extra sharpening.', '2011-05-20 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419454, 952445, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is nice but did you add a border? Borders are not allowed in minimal editing.</td>', 'This is nice but did you add a border? Borders are not allowed in minimal editing.', '2011-05-20 11:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419455, 952402, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think I need some tips on bird photography! I can never get them in flgiht.</td>', 'I think I need some tips on bird photography! I can never get them in flgiht.', '2011-05-20 11:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419456, 952233, 132694, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but two things, the pose is a bit ''stiff'' for the mood being depicted. Another idea is if you could make the feet ''dirty'' to invoke irony.</td>', 'Nice idea but two things, the pose is a bit ''stiff'' for the mood being depicted. Another idea is if you could make the feet ''dirty'' to invoke irony.', '2011-05-20 11:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419457, 951438, 68020, '<td valign="top">very nice (wondering how many shots this took!) - 8</td>', 'very nice (wondering how many shots this took!) - 8', '2011-05-20 11:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419458, 952356, 132694, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2011-05-20 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419461, 952381, 132694, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Nice shot.  just the kind of thing I the challenge was supposed to be (at least in my mind).  The softness of light and the subject and texture, line, reflection and the dab of color is perfect. I also like the way you have balanced the white on the edges and corners.</td>', 'Wow.  Nice shot.  just the kind of thing I the challenge was supposed to be (at least in my mind).  The softness of light and the subject and texture, line, reflection and the dab of color is perfect. I also like the way you have balanced the white on the edges and corners.', '2011-05-20 11:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419464, 952436, 132694, '<td valign="top">Something different from furs and flowers.  the folds in the sheet are in soft focus in the foreground which is a nice effect.</td>', 'Something different from furs and flowers.  the folds in the sheet are in soft focus in the foreground which is a nice effect.', '2011-05-20 11:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419465, 952330, 68020, '<td valign="top">very cool...hope you post how you did this! - 8</td>', 'very cool...hope you post how you did this! - 8', '2011-05-20 11:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419467, 951467, 132694, '<td valign="top">Oh those dogwood flowers! I like the veins in the petals show and the increased intensity of color at the tips which breaks the monotony and sets a pattern.  If you had cropped it on the right half, the composition could have been cleaner.  Right now, the upper left is a bit crowded.</td>', 'Oh those dogwood flowers! I like the veins in the petals show and the increased intensity of color at the tips which breaks the monotony and sets a pattern.  If you had cropped it on the right half, the composition could have been cleaner.  Right now, the upper left is a bit crowded.', '2011-05-20 11:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419468, 951697, 132694, '<td valign="top">Pretty portrait is all I can say.  Nice.</td>', 'Pretty portrait is all I can say.  Nice.', '2011-05-20 11:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6419469, 952413, 132694, '<td valign="top">lovely.</td>', 'lovely.', '2011-05-20 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
