(6419472, 952338, 132694, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on the lower part of the stem is difficult to reconcile with.  Since the background is clear, you could have gone for the lower f-stop.</td>', 'The soft focus on the lower part of the stem is difficult to reconcile with.  Since the background is clear, you could have gone for the lower f-stop.', '2011-05-20 11:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
