(6420376, 952413, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nothing soft about this light.  Blown out highlights on the dog''s head and in most of the background make this hard to look at.  Abuse of a a flash probably, as the light reflection caused the excessive overexposure on the outer 80% of the image.  It looks like a way overdone white vignette was applied.  Cute dog with good exposure on the eyes to nose.</td>', 'Nothing soft about this light.  Blown out highlights on the dog''s head and in most of the background make this hard to look at.  Abuse of a a flash probably, as the light reflection caused the excessive overexposure on the outer 80% of the image.  It looks like a way overdone white vignette was applied.  Cute dog with good exposure on the eyes to nose.', '2011-05-21 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6420401, 952407, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and detail.  Meets the challenge well.  I''d prefer a less centered composition, but one of the better images in this challenge.  Should be a top 10.</td>', 'Excellent exposure and detail.  Meets the challenge well.  I''d prefer a less centered composition, but one of the better images in this challenge.  Should be a top 10.', '2011-05-21 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
