(6421188, 951408, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very nice for the challenge, but I would not look at it more than in this context. 8.<br/>I am adding that, yes, I did look back and it''s certainly a very good picture.</td>', 'Very nice for the challenge, but I would not look at it more than in this context. 8.I am adding that, yes, I did look back and it''s certainly a very good picture.', '2011-05-22 11:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421189, 951697, 124815, '<td valign="top">That''s too much for words. I was hit three (or more?) times with cats in this challenge and start developing a painful longing to adopt one. Lucky that I cat-sit on occasion. But a black one.</td>', 'That''s too much for words. I was hit three (or more?) times with cats in this challenge and start developing a painful longing to adopt one. Lucky that I cat-sit on occasion. But a black one.', '2011-05-22 11:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421190, 951960, 124815, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of the art school days: "And now we all go to our easels and take a clean sheet of paper, charcoal, and start the study. Use very little bread for highlighting, if any."<br/>Very nice! Top 10.</td>', 'Reminds me so much of the art school days: "And now we all go to our easels and take a clean sheet of paper, charcoal, and start the study. Use very little bread for highlighting, if any."Very nice! Top 10.', '2011-05-22 11:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421191, 952417, 124815, '<td valign="top">A little jewel. A type of picture that probably most of us take and to which we all respond with a little childish joy or melancholy nod.</td>', 'A little jewel. A type of picture that probably most of us take and to which we all respond with a little childish joy or melancholy nod.', '2011-05-22 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421192, 952404, 124815, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t I think of this myself who adores dappled light? The simple answer is: my tiles are black.<br/>Yes, to me it''s clearly light on white and a nice approach, even with the toilet bowl incomplete.</td>', 'Why didn''t I think of this myself who adores dappled light? The simple answer is: my tiles are black.Yes, to me it''s clearly light on white and a nice approach, even with the toilet bowl incomplete.', '2011-05-22 11:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421193, 951490, 124815, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I have to repeat myself and write to you the same comment that I gave to a kindred spirit DPC-er:<br/> <br/>Going for the jugular here! Whoever gives less than 8 to this is heartless. Or ailurophobe. Now beat me on this word!</td>', 'Unfortunately I have to repeat myself and write to you the same comment that I gave to a kindred spirit DPC-er: Going for the jugular here! Whoever gives less than 8 to this is heartless. Or ailurophobe. Now beat me on this word!', '2011-05-22 11:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421195, 952356, 124815, '<td valign="top">Going for the jugular here! Whoever gives less than 8 to this is heartless. Or ailurophobe. Now beat me on this word!</td>', 'Going for the jugular here! Whoever gives less than 8 to this is heartless. Or ailurophobe. Now beat me on this word!', '2011-05-22 11:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421196, 951324, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very classical. And classy. A bit chalky though. Too bad that the rainbow of light hit the urn also. Great job.</td>', 'Very classical. And classy. A bit chalky though. Too bad that the rainbow of light hit the urn also. Great job.', '2011-05-22 11:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421197, 952415, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice and sweet, perfect for the challenge but personally a would like to be surprised a little by some unexpected element.</td>', 'Nice and sweet, perfect for the challenge but personally a would like to be surprised a little by some unexpected element.', '2011-05-22 11:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421198, 952422, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh yes! The <strike>fourth</strike> <strike>fifth</strike> no it''s fourth ( on second count), cat is here to enslave us! Wearing her best, even if it''s minimal editing. I have to get one!</td>', 'Oh yes! The fourth fifth no it''s fourth ( on second count), cat is here to enslave us! Wearing her best, even if it''s minimal editing. I have to get one!', '2011-05-22 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421199, 952145, 124815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition but in my opinion, in order to meet the challenge you decreased too much the contrast. Am I right? Perhaps a hint of a tone would have taken the monotonous bland grey away. Nevertheless, it''s certainly first page stuff.</td>', 'Beautiful composition but in my opinion, in order to meet the challenge you decreased too much the contrast. Am I right? Perhaps a hint of a tone would have taken the monotonous bland grey away. Nevertheless, it''s certainly first page stuff.', '2011-05-22 11:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421200, 952297, 113156, '<td valign="top">very nicely done, simpler is usually better and this does that well.</td>', 'very nicely done, simpler is usually better and this does that well.', '2011-05-22 11:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421201, 952330, 124815, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept but I have a problem with the composition. The grey around the image makes a vertical plane, the floating figure is in perspective. To make a bolder statement the figure should be in my opinion either much smaller or almost bigger than the "canvas". The effect is undecided. I left a long comment because I see the struggle.</td>', 'Interesting concept but I have a problem with the composition. The grey around the image makes a vertical plane, the floating figure is in perspective. To make a bolder statement the figure should be in my opinion either much smaller or almost bigger than the "canvas". The effect is undecided. I left a long comment because I see the struggle.', '2011-05-22 11:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421202, 951642, 124815, '<td valign="top">It surely responds well to the challenge, reminds me a bit of Venice, but it''s so washed out that it''s losing the mirage illusion.</td>', 'It surely responds well to the challenge, reminds me a bit of Venice, but it''s so washed out that it''s losing the mirage illusion.', '2011-05-22 11:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421204, 952323, 124815, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s necessarily light on white but it has a story to tell.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s necessarily light on white but it has a story to tell.', '2011-05-22 11:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421206, 951467, 113156, '<td valign="top">Awesome flower shot, hope you don''t get any low votes because of the dark leaves, i don''t care a 9.</td>', 'Awesome flower shot, hope you don''t get any low votes because of the dark leaves, i don''t care a 9.', '2011-05-22 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421207, 952381, 113156, '<td valign="top">Lovely feel to this, fine art.</td>', 'Lovely feel to this, fine art.', '2011-05-22 11:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421210, 952403, 49109, '<td valign="top">quite uninteresting subject and distribution of light is uneven. hard shadows distract a bit.</td>', 'quite uninteresting subject and distribution of light is uneven. hard shadows distract a bit.', '2011-05-22 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6421212, 952393, 49109, '<td valign="top">good focus and DOF. I can''t tell if there is a white background, though. wish you hadn''t shot in sepia.</td>', 'good focus and DOF. I can''t tell if there is a white background, though. wish you hadn''t shot in sepia.', '2011-05-22 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
