(6421634, 952014, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but not the implementation. The hands are so blocky for such delicate flowers. If you had used some ornate gold hands, I think this would have worked so much better. Probably an 8 with the right clock works. 7 without the clock. 6 as it is, since it detracts more than adds.<br/> <br/>Sorry!</td>', 'I like the idea, but not the implementation. The hands are so blocky for such delicate flowers. If you had used some ornate gold hands, I think this would have worked so much better. Probably an 8 with the right clock works. 7 without the clock. 6 as it is, since it detracts more than adds. Sorry!', '2011-05-22 21:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
