(6425653, 952413, 39057, '<td valign="top">LOL....I thought you commented on a "landscape" image ?!?!!  Hmmm this is strange.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Nothing soft about this light.  Blown out highlights on the dog''s head and in most of the background make this hard to look at.  Abuse of a a flash probably, as the light reflection caused the excessive overexposure on the outer 80% of the image.  It looks like a way overdone white vignette was applied.  Cute dog with good exposure on the eyes to nose. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'LOL....I thought you commented on a "landscape" image ?!?!!  Hmmm this is strange. Originally posted by hahn23: Nothing soft about this light.  Blown out highlights on the dog''s head and in most of the background make this hard to look at.  Abuse of a a flash probably, as the light reflection caused the excessive overexposure on the outer 80% of the image.  It looks like a way overdone white vignette was applied.  Cute dog with good exposure on the eyes to nose. ', '2011-05-27 01:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
