(6425869, 952208, 114233, '<td valign="top">Interesting spread of votes as you predicted. I''m guessing most of those 12 x 3 votes were people that didnt even notice the spider - not your fault as they are speed voting and didnt bother to take a careful look. Pity about the high ISO noise and the flower may be a bit too dominant and therefore the spider doesnt feature as strongly as it could have - but its a wonderful capture regardless especially seeing as it is not your normal subject. Job well done I say.</td>', 'Interesting spread of votes as you predicted. I''m guessing most of those 12 x 3 votes were people that didnt even notice the spider - not your fault as they are speed voting and didnt bother to take a careful look. Pity about the high ISO noise and the flower may be a bit too dominant and therefore the spider doesnt feature as strongly as it could have - but its a wonderful capture regardless especially seeing as it is not your normal subject. Job well done I say.', '2011-05-27 07:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
